@startuml DiagramaC4nivel3
title Modelo C4 — Nível 3: Componentes Internos do Backend

package "Backend Service (Python Hexagonal)" {
    [FacadeSingletonController] as CompFacade #LightBlue
    note right of CompFacade : Padrão Facade + Singleton

    [ExecutorDeComandos] as CompInvoker #LightGreen
    note right of CompInvoker : Padrão Command (Invoker)

    [Proxies de Autorização] as CompProxy #LightCoral
    note right of CompProxy : Padrão Proxy (RBAC)

    [GerenciadorDeUsuarios / Unidades] as CompServices #White

    [Publicador & Observadores] as CompObserver #Plum
    note right of CompObserver : Padrão Observer

    [HistoricoDeUnidade & Memento] as CompMemento #PeachPuff
    note right of CompMemento : Padrão Memento

    [Seletor & Fábricas de Repositório] as CompFactories #Moccasin
    note right of CompFactories : Factory Method + Abstract Factory

    [Repositórios & Adaptador de Log] as CompRepos #LightCyan
    note right of CompRepos : Repository + Adapter

    CompFacade --> CompInvoker : Delega execução
    CompInvoker --> CompProxy : Executa comando autorizado
    CompProxy --> CompServices : Delega se autorizado pelo perfil
    CompServices --> CompObserver : Notifica eventos de login
    CompServices --> CompMemento : Salva/restaura Memento de UBS
    CompServices --> CompFactories : Solicita repositórios
    CompFactories --> CompRepos : Instancia repositórios concretos
}
@enduml
